{"version":1,"content":"<p>女團Honey Punch新歌《Turbulence漩》，將於10月19日首次現場表演，歌曲邀來Serrini填詞，錄音選在中秋節假期，公司希望Honey Punch與監製度過，加深互相了解，錄音時擦出更多火花。</p><p>成員Colour和Chelsa準備傳統應節食品，給3位遠道而來的監製和隨行同事品嘗，原來幾位來賓都是首次接觸月餅，大家覺得月餅外型和味道都好有趣，大家吃得開心。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T14:20:39.152130+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T13:45:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:57:50.814286+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T14:17:49.255245+00:00","content_hash":"f5d736eb38ff288853d0bea627c13d8f5199b5fa284a946111d5ed74f08e7a92","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}